    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smyth Residential present an excellent development opportunity with this derelict building and outbuildings. The property has full planning permission for refurbishment and extension which will provide a living space of 228 square meters. The elevated site extends to 2.27 hectares/c.8 acres all in grass and is surrounded by mature hedging. The land is in excellent condition. The current owners have constructed a new access driveway and have installed a new septic tank.\r\n\r\nThe property is situated approximately 700 meters from Johnstownbridge Village and is approximately 2km from Junction 9 of the M4. Johnstownbridge is located approximately 44 km from Dublin city centre. Local amenities including schools, shops, church, hotel, medical centre and sports clubs are close by. Rail and commuter services are available from Enfield.\r\n\r\nNaas 41km, Maynooth 21km, Enfield 2.4km, Kilcock 14km, M50 34km."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Outside\r\n\r\nThe property stands on a site of 3.27 hectare/c.8 acres. The land is surrounded by mature hedging and is in excellent condition."
